# Chain Rules

Purpose:
  Laws that flow through every chain node. Unbreakable.

Rules:
  CR1:
    id: CR1
    text: Every arm MUST return to parent D0 after completion.
    applies_to: P1,D1,S1,C1,R1,DEP1

  CR2:
    id: CR2
    text: Human MUST approve before entering S1 from D1.
    applies_to: D1,S1

  CR3:
    id: CR3
    text: Human MUST approve before entering C1 from S1.
    applies_to: S1,C1

  CR4:
    id: CR4
    text: Token delta MUST be recorded for every stage.
    applies_to: P1,D1,S1,C1,R1,DEP1

  CR5:
    id: CR5
    text: AI MUST NOT read project/ before S1 approval.
    applies_to: C1

  CR6:
    id: CR6
    text: Every output MUST be validated before returning to D0.
    applies_to: P1,D1,S1,C1,R1,DEP1

  CR7:
    id: CR7
    text: If a stage fails, it MUST retry max 3 times before escalating.
    applies_to: P1,D1,S1,C1,R1,DEP1

  CR8:
    id: CR8
    text: Project root is source of truth for code; .sdd is source of truth for intent.
    applies_to: C1

  CR9:
    id: CR9
    text: docs/ is human language; .sdd/project/ is AI language.
    applies_to: D1,S1

  CR10:
    id: CR10
    text: Chain execution MUST be idempotent.
    applies_to: P1,D1,S1,C1,R1,DEP1

  CR11:
    id: CR11
    text: Every significant change MUST have a decision record (DEC-XXX).
    applies_to: D1,S1,C1,R1,DEP1

  CR12:
    id: CR12
    text: AI MUST check decisions/ before proposing changes.
    applies_to: D1,S1,C1

  CR13:
    id: CR13
    text: Conflicting decisions MUST block execution until resolved.
    applies_to: S1,C1

  CR14:
    id: CR14
    text: Implementation MUST reference approved decision IDs.
    applies_to: C1

State: +
